3. Literal type boundaries     

===================================================
typeof(5)    
integer     

typeof(2147483648)    
bigint     

typeof(9223372036854775807)    
bigint     

typeof(9223372036854775808)    
numeric     

typeof(1.5)    
numeric     

typeof(1.5e3)    
double     

    
4. CAST yields Fixed NUMERIC(p,s), bare stays Float     

===================================================
typeof( cast(1.5 as numeric(10,2)))    
numeric (10, 2)     

typeof( cast(1 as numeric(1,-84)))    
numeric (1, -84)     

typeof(1.5)    
numeric     

